{"id": "86269", "name": "משוואה עם sinh ו-cosh – פתרון בעזרת e^x (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Find all real solutions, if any, of the following equation</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[  {{CT:0}} \\sinh(x) + {{CT:0}} \\cosh(x) - {{CT:1}} = 0 . \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( x = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">(Do not use arcsinh or arccosh or arctanh in your answer. Express your answer in terms of a logarithm.)</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Divide by the common coefficient, write \\(\\sinh\\) and \\(\\cosh\\) with exponentials (their sum is \\(e^{x}\\)), and take the natural logarithm.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — Simplify</b><br>If<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[  {{CT:0}} \\sinh(x) + {{CT:0}} \\cosh(x) - {{CT:1}} = 0 . \\]</p>then<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[  {{CT:0}} \\sinh(x) + {{CT:0}} \\cosh(x) = {{CT:1}} . \\]</p>and dividing by the common coefficient:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[   \\sinh(x) +  \\cosh(x) = {{CT:2}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — Use the definitions of sinh and cosh</b><br>Therefore<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[   \\frac{e^{x}-e^{-x}}{2} +  \\frac{e^{x}+e^{-x}}{2} = {{CT:2}}. \\]</p>The terms \\(e^{-x}\\) cancel, and<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[   e^{x} = {{CT:2}}. \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 3 — Take the logarithm</b><br>The right-hand side is positive, so this equation has exactly one real solution (\\(\\ln\\) is the inverse of \\(e^{x}\\)), and<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ x ={{CT:3}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "asinh,acosh,atanh,arcsinh,arccosh,arctanh", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "wronganswer1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">You found \\(e^x\\); now take the logarithm.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["b", "c", "correctanswer", "wronganswer1"], "nvariants": 50}